  "name": "Example: Evaluating Combinations",
  "problem": "Evaluate ${}_{7}C_5.$",
  "worked_solution": "The number of combinations of $n$ objects taken $r$ at a time is given by the formula\n\n$$\n{}_nC_r = \\dfrac{n!}{(n-r)!r!}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=7$ and $r=5,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\require{cancel}\n\t\\eqalign{\n                            {}_{7}C_5 &= \\dfrac {7!} {(7 - 5)!5!} \\[5pt]\n                            &= \\dfrac {7!} {2!5!} \\[5pt]\n                            &= \\dfrac {7 \\cdot 6 \\cdot \\cancel{5!}} {2!\\cancel{5!}} \\[5pt]\n                            &= \\dfrac {7 \\cdot 6 } {2 \\cdot 1 } \\[5pt]\n \t\t\t    & = \\dfrac {42}{2} \\[5pt]\n                            &= 21.\n\t}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
